<title>SWEDEN: Key economic forecasts in Swedish budget - media.</title>
<headline>Key economic forecasts in Swedish budget - media.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are key economic indicators expected to be contained in the Swedish government's supplementary budget, according to leaked copy published by national news agency TT.</p>
<p>				 1997    1998    1999   2000</p>
<p> CPI (Dec-Dec)	     1.8     1.5     2.0    2.0</p>
<p> Unemployment		7.9     7.1     5.6    4.5</p>
<p> Household savings	 3.8     3.2     4.6    5.6</p>
<p>				  1996   1997     1998</p>
<p> GDP			    1.1     2.3	2.5</p>
<p> Private consumption	1.5     2.0	2.0</p>
<p> Public consumption	 1.7     0.1	0.2</p>
<p> Exports			5.6     6.3	5.8</p>
<p> Imports			3.5     5.1	5.6</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
